Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Installed-Size: 8192
Maintainer: ZAKKYCRYPT <dev@portman.local>
Homepage: https://github.com/zakkycrypt/portman
Description: Port Monitor & Manager for Linux
 PortMan is a powerful CLI and GUI application for monitoring and managing
 ports on Linux systems. Check which processes are using specific ports,
 kill them when needed, and monitor multiple ports in real-time.
 .
 Features:
  - Interactive TUI dashboard for real-time monitoring
  - Beautiful web GUI with modern interface
  - Check port usage with single command
  - Kill processes by port number
  - Monitor multiple ports simultaneously
  - View detailed process information (memory, CPU usage)
